WEBVTT

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:00.893
that you just don't have
anything left to give your job.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:04.277
Evidence shows that when
we're emotionally exhausted,

00:03:04.301 --> 00:03:05.706
our health suffers.

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:08.006
Burnout has been linked to depression,

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:11.766
memory loss, sleep problems,
alcohol abuse,

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:15.403
weakened immune systems
and even cardiovascular disease.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.089
Our job performance suffers, too.

00:03:19.113 --> 00:03:21.008
When we're burned out, we get less done

00:03:21.032 --> 00:03:22.956
and make more mistakes.

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.296
Eventually, we start
to think about quitting.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:27.456
(Music)

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.096
What causes burnout?

